      Q. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَجَوْرَبَ</span></b>  <i>He put on</i> [i. e., <i>on his own
foot</i> or <i>feet,</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَوْرَب</span> [i. e. <i>a sock</i> or <i>stocking,</i> or
<i>a pair of socks</i> or <i>stockings</i>]. (S, K.) And in
like manner, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تجورب جَوْرَبَيْنِ</span> [<i>He put on a pair
of socks</i> or <i>stockings</i>]. (TA.)

